# Draft knowledge entry: eigenpy OHOS bounded CMake parallelism
id: DRAFT-eigenpy-ohos-bounded-cmake-parallelism
trigger_tool: conan|cmake|ci
phase: build|timeout
error_signature: "conan create TIMED OUT after 3600s|L1_RESULT=fail: conan create timed out|Failed packages: eigenpy/3.13.0 (timeout)"

severity: 2
category: eigenpy|ohos|cmake|timeout|parallelism
match_keywords: eigenpy, OHOS, CMake, Ninja, conan create, timeout, tools.build:jobs

title: eigenpy OHOS CMake builds need bounded parallelism
root_cause: >
  eigenpy compiles many Eigen and Boost.Python translation units. A serial CMake
  build on official OHOS CI can resolve configure and link issues but still
  exceed the 3600s conan create budget before package and test_package complete.
affected_scope: >
  eigenpy 3.13.0 OHOS builds and similar CMake packages with many
  template-heavy Boost.Python or Eigen sources.
verification_cmd: |
  sh "$HOME/bin/run-ohos-shadow-ci.sh" archives/e/eigenpy/3.13.0
  CI_PACKAGES="archives/e/eigenpy/3.13.0" CI_BRANCH="feat/eigenpy-3.13.0" zsh ci/conan/build_and_test.sh

rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: bounded-cmake-parallel-build
rec_description: >
  Select Ninja when available, compute build jobs from tools.build:jobs with an
  OHOS default of 2, cap OHOS jobs at 2 to avoid worker memory pressure, and run
  cmake --build with --parallel. This keeps the installed ABI surface unchanged.
rec_command: |
  cmake -G Ninja -B build-ohos -S <src> ...
  cmake --build build-ohos --parallel 2
rec_auto_fix: false
rec_impl: eigenpy-ohos-bounded-cmake-parallelism

fallback_priority: 2
fallback_approach: keep-default-generator-with-parallel
fallback_description: >
  If ninja is not available in PATH, keep the default CMake generator and still
  pass --parallel with the bounded job count.
fallback_command: |
  cmake --build build-ohos --parallel 2
fallback_auto_fix: false
fallback_impl: cmake-default-generator-parallel

forbid_1_pattern: "cmake --build \\\"\\{\\}\\\"\\.format\\(bdir\\)"
forbid_1_reason: A serial CMake build can exceed the official 3600s conan create timeout for eigenpy.
forbid_1_consequence: PR CI fails in conan-build-test with eigenpy/3.13.0 (timeout).

principles: bounded-parallelism, preserve-installed-surface, prefer-ninja-when-present
source_event: eigenpy/3.13.0 official CI #34250 conan create timeout
last_updated: 2026-08-29
